    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Warpbane Task Force",
    "summary": "The Hallowed Ground for your army always covers your deployment zone and the area within 6\" of your PURIFIER SQUAD units. At the start of each phase, check No Man's Land and the opposing deployment zone separately: if you control half or more of the objective markers in one, it is Hallowed Ground until that phase ends. Models in your GREY KNIGHTS units re-roll Hit rolls of 1 for melee attacks and for ranged attacks against visible targets; for PURIFIER SQUAD units, or units wholly within Hallowed Ground, the whole Hit roll may be re-rolled instead.",
